{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "_doc": "Every config has one owner and at least one consumer. Checked by scripts/test-config-inventory.py (CI hygiene). Decisions: plan PLAN2 knowledge configs-p11. Optional descriptors of an entry: kind, format, schema (a tracked schema file or \"native\": the provider or tool defines the format), generated (written by a tool, not by hand) and live_path (where the effective copy lives, null when the tracked file is read in place).",
